+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `schema.sql` defines the database tables[39m                                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Tests are in `tests/`[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Empty `src/` directory[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                  [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Requirements[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mEach feature can be built independently:[39m                                                                                                                                                                                  [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### 1. User Management (`src/users/`)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- POST /users - Register new user (email, password, tenant_id)[39m                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- POST /users/login - Login, returns JWT token[39m                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- GET /users/me - Get current user profile[39m                                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- PATCH /users/:id/role - Change user role (admin only)[39m                                                                                                                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### 2. Data Ingestion (`src/ingest/`)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- POST /events - Ingest a single event[39m                                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- POST /events/batch - Ingest multiple events[39m                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### 3. Query Engine (`src/query/`)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- POST /query/count - Count events matching filter[39m                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- POST /query/timeseries - Time-bucketed event counts[39m                                                                                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- POST /query/breakdown - Event counts grouped by property[39m                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- POST /query/funnel - Multi-step funnel analysis[39m                                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### 4. Dashboard Configuration (`src/dashboards/`)[39m                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Full CRUD for dashboards and widgets[39m                                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Widgets: counter, timeseries, breakdown, funnel types[39m                                                                                                                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### 5. Data Export (`src/export/`)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- GET /export/events?format=csv|json - Export events[39m                                                                                                                                                                      [49m
